(@ SECTION "Examples")

(@ PARAGRAPH
"This documentation itself is written as calm1 macros. Both the
AsciiDoc for the GitHub README and chalk code that generates
Subversion wiki for CHICKEN are generated from the same set of calm1
macros, with minor differences. The macros are run through calm1 by a
(@ FILE \"GNUmakefile\").")

(@ PARAGRAPH "For AsciiDoc, the macros are
(@ LINK \"(@ CALM1_CODE)/README.adoc.calm1\" \"README.adoc.calm1\"),
(@ LINK \"(@ CALM1_CODE)/macros/adoc.calm1\" \"macros/adoc.calm1\"),
and most of the other macro sources in the
(@ LINK \"(@ CALM1_CODE)/macros\" \"macros\")
directory.")

(@ PARAGRAPH "For chalk, the macros are
(@ LINK \"(@ CALM1_CODE)/calm1.chalk.calm1\" \"calm1.chalk.calm1\"),
(@ LINK \"(@ CALM1_CODE)/macros/chalk.calm1\" \"macros/chalk.calm1\"),
and most of the other macro sources in the
(@ LINK \"(@ CALM1_CODE)/macros\" \"macros\")
directory.")
